Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 02:35:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD reviewed-feature completion prompts to close or
 reopen patch-agent chats

Ask for explicit yes/no completion after clean review, keep confirmation responses in controller state, hide closed patch-agent rows in the terminal, and route later follow-up chat back to the reopened agent.
